Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://dbeaver.io/
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17),
 libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.20),
 libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.36),
 libatk1.0-0,
 libcairo2,
 libpango-1.0-0,
 libpangocairo-1.0-0,
 libgdk-pixbuf2.0-0 | libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0,
 libfontconfig1,
 libfreetype6,
 libx11-6,
 libxext6,
 libxi6,
 libxrender1,
 libxtst6,
 libxss1,
 libasound2 | libasound2t64,
 zlib1g
Recommends: libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37 | libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0,
 libgl1 | libgl1-mesa-glx,
 libglu1-mesa,
 libsecret-1-0
Description: Universal database manager and SQL client
 DBeaver is a free multi-platform database tool for developers,
 SQL programmers, analysts and DBAs. It supports all popular
 databases: MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite, Oracle, DB2, SQL Server,
 Sybase, MS Access, Teradata, Firebird, Apache Hive, Phoenix,
 Presto, etc.
 .
 Repackaged from the upstream DBeaver Community Edition release for
 UOS 20 / Debian 10+ / Ubuntu 18.04+ (@ARCH@), with a bundled Eclipse
 Temurin 11 JRE so no system Java is required.
 .
 Recommends provide libraries SWT loads lazily: WebKit for the embedded
 browser, GL/GLU for the OpenGL canvas, and libsecret for OS keyring
 integration. DBeaver starts and works without them; only those specific
 features need them.
